NAME
    gcloud logging recent-queries - manage Cloud Logging recent queries

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud logging recent-queries COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Commands for managing Cloud Logging recent queries. A recent query
    describes a query executed on the Logs Explorer or Log Analytics page
    within the last ~ 30 days.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     list
        List Logging recent queries.
